<https://threadbiz.ai/journey/neighborhood-table-001/entry-000> <https://threadbiz.ai/ontology#description> "Owner's original voice note announcing the business, its name, and its purpose. This is the source behind Business Memory Asset v1's confirmedFact (source: owner-voice-note-1, confirmed 2026-09-21)." .
