<https://threadbiz.ai/journey/neighborhood-table-001/entry-000> <https://threadbiz.ai/ontology#sourceReference> "Hey! Okay, so — I'm finally doing this. I'm calling it The Neighborhood Table. Basically, every week, I'm gonna cook a small batch of meals using my family's recipes — the ones my mom used to make — and drop them off for a few neighbors to try, pre-order style. I do all the cooking myself, so it's staying small for now, just me in the kitchen. The whole point is I want people to actually look forward to it every week, you know? Not just a random meal, something they trust, something that feels like it's made by someone who cares. Starting tiny, but excited to see where this goes." .
<https://threadbiz.ai/journey/neighborhood-table-001/entry-000> <https://threadbiz.ai/ontology#sourceType> "voice-note-transcript" .
