<https://threadbiz.ai/journey/neighborhood-table-001/entry-001> <https://threadbiz.ai/ontology#description> "Launched The Neighborhood Table with a modest batch of vegetable and herb soup, made from the last of the season's tomatoes. Honest, small-batch, 'just starting out' framing rather than an oversold launch." .
<https://threadbiz.ai/journey/neighborhood-table-001/entry-001> <https://threadbiz.ai/ontology#emotionalTone> "warm, humble" .
