<https://threadbiz.ai/journey/neighborhood-table-001/entry-001> <https://threadbiz.ai/ontology#explainability> "Generated using Business Memory Asset v1 and Journey Ledger entry-000 (origin voice note). Directly draws on the confirmedFact (sourced from owner-voice-note-1, confirmed 2026-09-21): 'started from family heritage recipes, began with a small weekly pre-order drop for neighbors.' preferredTone='warm, personal, rooted in family and heritage' shaped the humble visual and caption style. seasonalContext ('menu shifts with seasonal ingredients') drove the choice of a late-tomato-season soup. Caption checked against avoidPhrases (gourmet, chef-inspired, limited time only) — none used." .
